\title{Majorana and transfer comparisons}
\date{2026-11-17}

\p{Majorana trace functionals, Grassmann coefficient
functionals and transfer operators carry different
multiplications and reflection data. Their positivity
results can be compared only with those data visible.
The elementary exterior obstruction gives a starting point
for the Majorana comparison; the lattice sources specify
the additional action and boundary hypotheses.}

